*.log

# Intermediate SSR bundle — consumed by scripts/prerender.mjs, never deployed.
dist-ssr/

# NOTE: dist/ is deliberately NOT ignored. This project's build script is
# `echo 'Using pre-built dist'`, so Hostinger serves the committed dist/
# verbatim — the live asset hash matches it exactly. Ignoring the build output
# while the host serves it is how the deployed site drifted from source in the
# first place. Regenerate with `npm run build:local` and commit the result.
